Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

garak — NVIDIA
  https://github.com/NVIDIA/garak
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  The 99 probe files under
  orchestrator/orchestrator/redteam/probes/garak/ are wrappers around
  garak's probe catalog. They were generated by
  orchestrator/scripts/wrap_garak_probes.py, which reads attack prompts
  out of garak Probe classes and restates them in the Argus probe schema.
  Each wrapper records its originating garak class in its `_attribution`
  field.

  garak is not vendored in this repository and is not a runtime
  dependency of Argus. It is installed separately
  (orchestrator/requirements-tools.txt) only when regenerating those
  wrapper files.

